### AstroGann API collection — VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Local seed accounts only (docs/TEST_ACCOUNTS.md). Run the login requests first; the tokens are captured.

@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### Public app config
GET {{base}}/settings

### Login as the active trader (mobile)
# @name loginUser
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user.active@astrogann.test", "password": "password", "device_type": "mobile", "fcm_token": null }

###
@userToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### Current account
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Categories (tabs)
GET {{base}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Entries of category 1 (7 or 3 by subscription)
GET {{base}}/categories/1/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Subscription
GET {{base}}/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Mark all notifications read
POST {{base}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Update FCM token
POST {{base}}/update-fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fcm_token": "device-token-from-firebase" }

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Admin

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@astrogann.test", "password": "password", "device_type": "web" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### Add entry (multipart)
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AstroBoundary

--AstroBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category_id"

1
--AstroBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="entry_date"

2026-10-06
--AstroBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="entry_time"

15:30
--AstroBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="chart.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../backend/public/uploads/entries/seed-nifty50-1.png
--AstroBoundary--

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Super Admin

# @name loginSuper
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "superadmin@astrogann.test", "password": "password", "device_type": "web" }

###
@superToken = {{loginSuper.response.body.data.token}}

### List users
GET {{base}}/admin/users?q=trader
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### Create user
POST {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New Trader", "email": "new.trader@astrogann.test", "phone": "+91 90000 00009", "password": "password1", "password_confirmation": "password1" }

### Deactivate user 3
PATCH {{base}}/admin/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "inactive" }

### Create admin with an extra permission
POST {{base}}/admin/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Second Admin", "email": "admin2@astrogann.test", "password": "password1", "password_confirmation": "password1", "permissions": ["logs.view"] }

### Activate subscription with payment
POST {{base}}/admin/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 4, "action": "activate", "end_date": "2026-11-06", "payment": { "amount": 1999, "transaction_ref": "UPI-001" } }

### Extend
POST {{base}}/admin/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 4, "action": "extend", "end_date": "2026-12-06" }

### Expire
POST {{base}}/admin/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 4, "action": "expire" }
